OL,3,GNEWSAReform councillor resigns as
OL,4,Acommittee chair
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Reform UK councillor in Wakefield has
OL,7,Fquit as a committee chair amid claims
OL,8,Fhe has been suspended by the party
OL,9,Fpending an investigation into his
OL,10,Fconduct.
OL,12,FWakefield Council confirmed Jacob
OL,13,FPadget had resigned from his role
OL,14,Fleading the adult services and health
OL,15,Foverview and scrutiny committee.
OL,17,FIn a statement on Monday, Reform's
OL,18,FWakefield branch said Padget had been
OL,19,Fsuspended from the party "with
OL,20,Fimmediate effect" while an internal
OL,21,Finquiry was carried out.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
