OL,3,GNEWSAReform councillor resigns as
OL,4,Acommittee chair
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut a national Reform spokesperson said
OL,7,Fhe had "not been suspended by the party
OL,8,F- only the central party can suspend
OL,9,Fmembers. The branch does not have the
OL,10,Fpower to unilaterally suspend people."
OL,11,FPadget told the BBC he did not want to
OL,12,Fcomment.
